{
  "_readme": [
    "Sound. Every entry is synthesized in code right now, so the game is not",
    "silent while the real assets are commissioned — see docs/tidy-audio-assets.md",
    "for the brief.",
    "",
    "TO DROP IN A REAL SOUND: put the file in sound/ and set \"src\".",
    "That's the whole swap.",
    "    \"gold\": { \"src\": \"sound/sfx_gold.mp3\", \"vol\": 0.9 }",
    "",
    "KEEP THE synth BLOCK when you add a src. It stops being played, but",
    "pitchJitter is still read from it (see playBuffer in js/audio.js), which is",
    "what keeps a file heard 800 times a run from turning to sandpaper — and it",
    "is the fallback if the file ever fails to load.",
    "",
    "One file can serve several triggers: toss, dropFloor and fling all point at",
    "the one toss recording. Anything still on \"src\": null is synthesized and",
    "wants a real recording — see docs/tidy-audio-assets.md.",
    "",
    "synth fields:",
    "  type   sine | triangle | square | sawtooth | noise",
    "  f      starting frequency in Hz",
    "  to     frequency to glide to (omit for a steady tone)",
    "  dur    seconds",
    "  vol    0-1",
    "  decay  'exp' (default) or 'linear'",
    "  seq    play several of these back to back, [{f,to,dur,at}]",
    "  pitchJitter  +/- fraction of random pitch per play, so a sound heard",
    "               800 times a run doesn't turn to sandpaper"
  ],

  "master": 0.7,
  "sfxVolume": 1,
  "musicVolume": 0.6,

  "_musicNote": [
    "MUSIC. \"menu\" plays on the title screen, the job board and Free Play;",
    "\"play\" plays during a level. Both loop unless you set \"loop\": false.",
    "vol is a per-track trim (0-1) applied under the music slider, for when one",
    "track is mastered hotter than another.",
    "",
    "PER-CHARACTER MUSIC IS A DATA EDIT. Add a track here, then give a client",
    "\"music\": \"<trackId>\" in clients.json and their jobs use it — no code.",
    "Boot validation checks that the name resolves, so a typo is an error",
    "screen and not a silent fallback to the default."
  ],
  "music": {
    "menu": { "src": "sound/music_tidy_menu.mp3",   "vol": 1 },
    "play": { "src": "sound/music_tidy_play01.mp3", "vol": 1 }
  },

  "sounds": {
